OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a mostly cloudy day
OL,6,Fwith some light rain and drizzle
OL,7,Fpossible in the east but dry with
OL,8,Fbrighter spells in the west.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FLargely cloudy at first but
OL,11,Fincreasing clear spells developing,
OL,12,Fallowing areas of frost and fog to
OL,13,Fform. Staying cloudier around the
OL,14,Fcoast which may may still see the odd
OL,15,Fshower.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FA chilly start with some fog
OL,18,Fpatches. Otherwise mostly dry with
OL,19,Fvariable cloud and bright or sunny
OL,20,Fspells. Some showers around the coast.
OL,21,FAreas of fog developing in the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
