OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FDry
OL,6,FTuesday with variable cloud
OL,7,Finterspersed with sunny spells. Bright
OL,8,Fspells and perhaps a few showers on
OL,9,FWednesday. Colder on Thursday with
OL,10,Fscattered showers and strengthening
OL,11,Fwinds. Overnight frost possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
